{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level component and trust-boundary overview of the Wagmi concentrator: external users and ERC20 tokens enter through Factory and Multipool interfaces; Factory deploys and wires Multipool and MultiStrategy, registers pools with Dispatcher, and depends on Uniswap V3 factory/pools and bytecode providers; Multipool coordinates deposits, withdrawals, liquidity positions, fee accounting, quotes, and rebalancing against trusted underlying pools and approved swap targets. Show interface contracts, math libraries, emitted events, and control/data flows between these components and external dependencies.",
